  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Accessories are lagging on client side when looking around, and they are not being moved with Y axis\n\nAnd the lag is more noticable if the accessories are bigger\n\nTo clarify the accessories have noticable latency when looking around and they drag.\n\n(They do not lag to others)",
